=b, IF=a, K=k+1=c.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","a":["takrorlash","tarmoqlanish","hisoblagich"],"b":["tanlash","ko‘p elementni ko‘rish","moslar sonini yig‘ish"],"pairs":[[0,1],[1,0],[2,2]]},{"id":"ALG-05-006","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":1,"stem":"Kvadrat tenglamada diskriminantga qarab 0, 1 yoki 2 ildizni tanlashning asosiy tuzilmasi?","exp":"D>0, D=0, D<0 holatlari ajratiladi; tayyor algoritmga kiradi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Ketma-ket saralash","Tarmoqlanish","Shartsiz rekursiya","Majburiy takrorlash"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-05-007","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"Qaysi jarayon aynan aralash algoritmga misol?","exp":"FOR+IF yig‘indisi qo‘shma boshqaruv talab qiladi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Faqat a+b ni bir marta hisoblash","Bitta sonni ekranga chiqarish","Faqat qiymatlarni o‘qib tugatish","1..n dan juft qiymatlarning yig‘indisini topish"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-05-008","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"A(n): n marta s:=s+i, B(n): n marta faqat i juft bo‘lsa s:=s+i. Qaysi algoritm tarkibi aralash?","exp":"B tarkibida takrorlash va tanlash bor.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Har ikkisi faqat chiziqli","Har ikkisi faqat tarmoqlanish","B: sikl va shart birga","A: faqat qo‘shish bor"],"ans":2},{"id":"ALG-05-009","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"«Baho=5» tekshiruvini 25 ta baho uchun bir marta sikldan tashqarida bajarish nega noto‘g‘ri?","exp":"Shart har elementga tatbiq qilinishi lozim.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Har bir baho ikki marta tekshiriladi","Baholar tartiblanib qoladi","Hisoblash avtomatik to‘xtaydi","Faqat oxirgi yoki bitta baho tekshiriladi"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-05-010","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"EKUB ayirish algoritmida A>B bo‘lsa qaysi sonni yangilash kerak?","exp":"Katta sondan kichik son ayriladi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["A:=A−B","B:=A−B","A:=A+B","B:=A+B"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-05-011","ch":5,"fmt":"Y2","lv":2,"stem":"Moslang.","exp":"Diskriminant bo‘yicha uch holat ajraladi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","a":["D>0","D=0","D<0"],"b":["bitta haqiqiy ildiz","ikkita turli haqiqiy ildiz","haqiqiy ildiz yo‘q"],"pairs":[[0,1],[1,0],[2,2]]},{"id":"ALG-05-012","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"D=b²−4ac<0 bo‘lsa haqiqiy sonlar sohasida qaysi xulosa to‘g‘ri?","exp":"a≠0 bo‘lgan kvadrat tenglamada D<0 haqiqiy ildiz yo‘qligini bildiradi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Tenglama chiziqli bo‘lib qoladi","Haqiqiy ildiz mavjud emas","Har doim ikkita haqiqiy ildiz bor","Har doim bitta haqiqiy ildiz bor"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-05-013","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"[5,4,5,3,5] baholarida hisoblagich K=0; har baho 5 bo‘lsa K:=K+1. K natija?","exp":"5 qiymati uch marta uchraydi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["5","3","2","4"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-05-014","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"1 dan 10 gacha faqat 3 ga karrali qiymatlar qo‘shiladi. Yig‘indi?","exp":"3+6+9=18.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["18","15","21","30"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-05-015","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"[−2,5,−3,4] ro‘yxatida musbat sonlar