,{"id":"ALG-05-021","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":4,"stem":"EKUB ayirish algoritmida (A,B)=(21,15). Birinchi ikkita yangilanishdan so‘ng?","exp":"(21,15)→(6,15)→(6,9).","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["(15,6)","(9,6)","(6,9)","(6,15)"],"ans":2},{"id":"ALG-05-022","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":4,"stem":"S=0; FOR i=1..5 DO IF i mod 2=1 THEN S:=S+i*i. S?","exp":"Faqat i=1,3,5 uchun 1²+3²+5²=35.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["35","55","25","15"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-05-023","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":4,"stem":"Aralash algoritmda IF sharti sikldan tashqariga ko‘chirildi. Qachon natija o‘zgarishi mumkin?","exp":"Iteratsiya qiymatiga bog‘liq filtrni bir marta tekshirish xato.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Shart barcha iteratsiyada bir xil bo‘lsa","Sikl umuman ishlamasa ham farq bo‘lmaydi","Hech qachon natija o‘zgarmaydi","Shart takrorlanayotgan qiymatga bog‘liq bo‘lsa"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-05-024","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":4,"stem":"Shart va sikl birga ishlatilgan algoritmda chiqishdan oldin qaysi holat tekshirilishi zarur?","exp":"Shartning rost va yolg‘on yo‘llari ham natijaga olib kelishi kerak.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["Barcha kirish qiymatlari musbat bo‘lishi","Har doim ikki marta chiqarilishi","Har bir mantiqiy tarmoq yakuniy natijani aniqlashi","Faqat birinchi takrorlash hisobga olinishi"],"ans":2},{"id":"ALG-05-025","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":5,"stem":"12 ta son orasida ham manfiy, ham toq bo‘lganlarning yig‘indisi kerak. Qaysi shart ishlatiladi?","exp":"Ikkala talab bir vaqtda bajariladi, sikl ichidagi filtr AND.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["(x=0) OR (x mod 2=0)","(x<0) AND (x mod 2≠0)","(x<0) OR (x mod 2=0)","(x>0) AND (x mod 2=0)"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-05-026","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":5,"stem":"25 bahodan «5» lar sanaladi. FOR i=1..25, K=0. Agar baho=5 bo‘lsa K:=K+2 yozilgan. To‘g‘ri tuzatish?","exp":"Bitta mos baho bitta o‘quvchi sifatida hisoblanadi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["K:=0","K:=K+1","K:=K−2","K:=25"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-05-027","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":5,"stem":"Kvadrat tenglama ax²+bx+c=0 uchun algoritm istalgan a ni qabul qiladi. Qaysi qo‘shimcha tekshiruv zarur?","exp":"a=0 bo‘lsa bu kvadrat tenglama emas; 2a maxrajda nol bo‘ladi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["a=0 ni chiziqli tenglama holati sifatida alohida ko‘rish","Faqat b>0 bo‘lgan tenglamalarni maxsus ajratib hisoblash","Diskriminant D ni har doim musbat deb belgilash","Tenglamaga har doim ikkita haqiqiy ildiz tayinlash"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-05-028","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":5,"stem":"Sikl ichida IF x>5 THEN S:=S+x, lekin x har safar yangi kiritilmaydi. Maqsad n ta alohida sonni tekshirish. Nuqson nima?","exp":"Har iteratsiyada yangi x olinmasa bitta qiymat takror tekshiriladi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["S faqat 1 ga boshlanishi kerak","Har safar S noldan boshlansin","IF shartini butunlay olib tashlash kerak","Kiritish sikl ichida takrorlanishi kerak"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-05-029","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":5,"stem":"Diagrammada barcha ko‘rsatilgan qiymatlarni ko‘rib, faqat juftlarini qo‘shish algoritmida n=6 bo‘lsa S?\n\n**Chizma talab qilinadi:** flow_even. Grafik qo‘shilmaguncha savol nashr qilinmasin.","exp":"2+4+6=12.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":"flow_even","status":"draft","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["12","9","15","6"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-05-030","ch":5,"fmt":"Y1","lv":5,"stem":"(A,B)=(18,30) dan ayirish asosidagi EKUB algoritmini bajaring. Yakuniy chiqish?\n\n**Chizma talab qilinadi:** flow_euclid. Grafik qo‘shilmaguncha savol nashr qilinmasin.","exp":"(18,30)→(18,12)→(6,12)→(6,6), EKUB=6.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 45–47 (24-dars: aralash algoritmlar)","diagram":"flow_euclid","status":"draft","construct":"S3.ALGO.03","opts":["12","18","3","6"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-06-001","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":1,"stem":"Dry run nima?","exp":"Qadamlar va o‘zgaruvchilar qo‘lda kuzatiladi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["Algoritmni qiymatlar bilan qo‘lda izma-iz bajarish","Faqat dasturdagi izohlarni o‘chirish","Kompyuter xotirasini formatlash","Algoritmni doimo bekor qilish"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-06-002","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":1,"stem":"Trace table qanday maqsadda kerak?","exp":"Izma-iz bajarish jadvali xatoni topishga yordam beradi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["Faqat dastur buyruqlarining matnini taqqoslash","Dasturning ishlash vaqtini qadamlar bo‘yicha baholash","Qadamlar bo‘yicha o‘zgaruvchi qiymatlarini qayd etish","Faol fayllar o‘lchamini jadval bo‘yicha saralash"],"ans":2},{"id":"ALG-06-003","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":1,"stem":"Normal test ma’lumoti nimani bildiradi?","exp":"Normal test odatiy to‘g‘ri kirishdir.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["Eng oxirgi ruxsat etilgan qiymat","Kutilgan kirish sohasi ichidagi oddiy qiymat","Kirish sohasi tashqarisidagi qiymat","Faqat bo‘sh matnli kirish"],"ans":1},