:"7..17 yosh uchun qaysi qiymat noto‘g‘ri kirish?","exp":"18 yuqori chegaradan tashqarida.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["17","12","18","7"],"ans":2},{"id":"ALG-06-009","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"IF X>=10 shartida xato ehtimolini tekshirish uchun qaysi juftlik muhim?","exp":"9 va 10 chegaraning ikki tomonini tekshiradi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["9 va 10","-9 va -8","20 va 30","1 va 2"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-06-010","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"A:=7; B:=A; A:=1. Qaysi o‘zgaruvchi eski qiymatni saqlaydi?","exp":"B=7 saqlanadi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["B","A","Hech qaysisi","Ikkalasi"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-06-011","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"Sikl sanagichi 1..5 qiymatlarni olishi kerak. FOR i:=1..4 yozuvi qanday xato?","exp":"5 holati chetda qolgan — off-by-one.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["Sintaktik matn kodi xatosi","Kirish tipi har doim noaniq","Faqat nolga bo‘lish xatosi","Oxirgi qiymatni qamramaslik xatosi"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-06-012","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":2,"stem":"Bir algoritm N=1 da ishlasa, ammo N=0 shartli ruxsat etilgan bo‘lsa, qaysi test zarur?","exp":"0 minimal qiymat bo‘lsa, aynan chegaraviy test kerak.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["Faqat natijani bezash","Faqat N=100 ni tekshirish","Faqat ikki martalik N=1 ni tekshirish","N=0 kirishini tekshirish"],"ans":3},{"id":"ALG-06-013","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"Trace: A:=3; B:=7; T:=A; A:=B; B:=T. Oxirgi B?","exp":"Vaqtinchalik T eski A=3 ni saqlaydi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["10","3","0","7"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-06-014","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"Trace: A:=3; B:=7; A:=A+1; C:=A*B. C?","exp":"A=4, B=7, C=4·7=28.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["28","35","21","29"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-06-015","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"Trace: X:=2; X:=X*X; X:=X+3. X?","exp":"2²=4; keyin 4+3=7.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["4","7","5","11"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-06-016","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"A:=2; B:=5; T:=A; A:=B; B:=T. Oxirgi (A,B) nimaga teng?","exp":"T vaqtinchalik eski A ni saqlaydi.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["(2,2)","(5,2)","(2,5)","(5,5)"],"ans":1},{"id":"ALG-06-017","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"Trace: A:=12; B:=4; A:=A div B; B:=B+A. B?","exp":"12 div 4=3, so‘ng B=4+3=7.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["3","4","7","16"],"ans":2},{"id":"ALG-06-018","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":3,"stem":"N=0. WHILE N>0 DO N:=N−1. Sikl tana qanchalik bajariladi?","exp":"WHILE sharti boshidan yolg‘on.","source":"9-sinf milliy, PDF 29–47 (qadamlar, jadval, dastur), 2026 spetsifikatsiya, PDF 4","diagram":null,"status":"review","construct":"S3.ALGO.04","opts":["0 marta","1 marta","2 marta","Cheksiz"],"ans":0},{"id":"ALG-06-019","ch":6,"fmt":"Y1","lv":4,"stem":"Algoritm IF X>=0 THEN «mu